WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.216
A responsible-practice statement describes concrete care for the

00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:06.850
current artifact. In this supplied fictional example, the

00:00:06.908 --> 00:00:11.041
design is for tabletop explanation only. Private customer

00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:15.232
records are excluded, missing dates remain questions, and

00:00:15.278 --> 00:00:18.541
delivery waits for recorded human approval. The author

00:00:18.587 --> 00:00:21.142
retains test notes and corrects and retests changes

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:25.081
to the gate. The AI-role disclosure says AI

00:00:25.173 --> 00:00:28.157
helped draft the explanation and suggest review checks.

00:00:28.807 --> 00:00:31.884
The human chose the criteria, inspected the drafts,

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:36.308
corrected unsupported claims, and checked the records. Neither

00:00:36.377 --> 00:00:38.978
AI did everything nor I worked without AI

00:00:39.047 --> 00:00:42.600
would describe that supplied record truthfully. Write both

00:00:42.647 --> 00:00:44.852
statements in your own language using your actual

00:00:44.922 --> 00:00:48.252
evidence. Match safeguards to the finished version and

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.632
place the disclosure where the intended reviewer can

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:51.119
find it.
